{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"QueryView","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You get a view from a world’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"query(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" methods. Each row is a tuple of the entity, labeled"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entity"},{"type":"text","text":", followed by the values of the query’s terms in the order the query lists them, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loop can name them all:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Name(value: \"comet\"), Velocity(dx: 3, dy: 4))","world.spawn(Name(value: \"statue\"), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 1), Frozen())","","for (_, name, velocity) in world.query(Name.self, Velocity.self).without(Frozen.self) {","    print(name.value, velocity.dx)","    \/\/ Prints \"comet 3.0\"","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A view is a snapshot of the world it came from: changing the world while you iterate doesn’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change what the view shows, though the first write to each component type copies that type’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"storage. To change components while you visit them, use one of the world’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"update"},{"text":" methods","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Narrow a view with the same methods a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query"},{"type":"text","text":" offers, such as "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/with(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/without(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":". Each returns a new view."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rows come in the order of the list the view walks: the storage of the queried or required type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that the fewest entities hold, or a shorter list where one applies, such as a target’s sources"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/related(_:to:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or a cached query’s entities. That order depends only on the steps that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"built the world, so it’s the same every time you run the same steps."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/queryview"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A lazy sequence of the entities that match a query, with the components the query reads."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/ST"]}],"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/QueryView.swift#L70","fileName":"QueryView.swift"},"title":"QueryView","ext